<title>NEW ZEALAND: BT Australia ups stake in St Lukes.</title>
<headline>BT Australia ups stake in St Lukes.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust Australia on Wednesday said it had increased its relevant interest in St Lukes Group to 54.15 percent from 51.43 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
